B.aaJ=new A.hw("Say, \u201cO My servants who have transgressed against themselves [by sinning], do not despair of the mercy of Allah. Indeed, Allah forgives all sins.\u201d","Quran 39:53 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaY=new A.hw("\u2026despair not of relief from Allah\u2026","Quran 12:87 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaN=new A.hw("Allah is more pleased with the repentance of His servant than a traveller who finds his lost camel again.","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 summary",!1)
B.aaP=new A.hw("If you did not sin, Allah would replace you with a people who sin, seek forgiveness, and are forgiven.","Sahih Muslim 2749 \u2014 summary",!1)
B.ab_=new A.hw("\u2026indeed I am near. I respond to the invocation of the supplicant when he calls upon Me\u2026","Quran 2:186 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaU=new A.hw("A man who had killed ninety-nine people asked whether he could still repent, and the hadith tells us the door was open to him. Nothing you have done has closed a door Allah keeps open.","Sahih Muslim 2766 \u2014 the hundred-souls hadith, summary",!1)
B.ab0=new A.hw("Allah accepts the repentance of His servant until the soul reaches the throat.","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3537 \u2014 hasan (Darussalam)",!1)
B.aaZ=new A.hw("For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease. Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.","Quran 94:5\u20136",!1)
B.aaO=new A.hw("No fatigue, illness, worry, grief, harm or distress touches a Muslim, even a thorn\u2019s prick, but Allah expiates some of his sins for it.","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 summary",!0)
B.aaQ=new A.hw(u.an,"Quran 13:28 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaV=new A.hw("\u2026He is with you wherever you are\u2026","Quran 57:4 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaW=new A.hw("Allah says: I am just as My servant thinks I am.",u.M,!1)
B.aaM=new A.hw("None of you should die except while thinking well of Allah.","Sahih Muslim 2877",!0)
B.aaX=new A.hw("\u2026Your Lord has decreed upon Himself mercy\u2026","Quran 6:54 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaI=new A.hw("\u2026My mercy encompasses all things\u2026","Quran 7:156 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaK=new A.hw("\u2026He called out within the darknesses, \u201cThere is no deity except You; exalted are You. Indeed, I have been of the wrongdoers.\u201d So We responded to him and saved him from the distress\u2026","Quran 21:87\u201388 \u2014 excerpt",!1)
B.aaL=new A.hw("\u2026\u201cI only complain of my suffering and my grief to Allah, and I know from Allah that which you do not know.\u201d","Quran 12:86 \u2014 Ya\u02bfqub \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645, excerpt",!1)
B.aaR=new A.hw("Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you]. And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life].","Quran 93:3\u20134",!1)
B.aaT=new A.hw("\u2026Fear not. Indeed, I am with you both; I hear and I see.","Quran 20:46 \u2014 Allah to Musa and Harun, excerpt",!1)
B.aaS=new A.hw("If he comes to Me walking, I go to him running.",u.M,!1)
