B.bPo=new A.eP("seerah-01","The Year of the Elephant","The hour of birth, and the army that could not enter Makkah.")
B.bPM=new A.eP("seerah-02","The Orphan of Makkah","Father gone before birth, mother at six, grandfather at eight \u2014 and yet al-Amin, the trustworthy.")
B.bPK=new A.eP("seerah-03","Al-Amin, The Trustworthy","The title Makkah gave him before revelation \u2014 character precedes the call.")
B.bPz=new A.eP("seerah-04","The Cave of Hira","Forty years old, seeking quiet \u2014 and the first word is Iqra.")
B.bPE=new A.eP("seerah-31","Iqra \u2014 The First Word","Read, in the name of your Lord. The first revelation chose knowledge.")
B.bPn=new A.eP("seerah-05","Three Years of Whispers","Secret teaching, then open call \u2014 patience measured in years.")
B.bPp=new A.eP("seerah-06","Bilal and the Heavy Sand","One word \u2014 Ahad \u2014 heavier than the mountain of sand on his chest.")
B.bPD=new A.eP("seerah-07","The Night of the Journey","From the Haram to Jerusalem to the seven heavens in one night.")
B.bPr=new A.eP("seerah-08","The Boycott","Three years of siege in the valley \u2014 and the believers stayed.")
B.bPI=new A.eP("seerah-09","The First Hijrah","To Abyssinia, where a just king protected the weak \u2014 Musab carried the message.")
B.bPs=new A.eP("seerah-10","The Conversion of Umar","The man who came to kill left proclaiming \u2014 strength that found its direction.")
B.bPA=new A.eP("seerah-11","Taif","Driven to a vineyard outside the city, he prayed to Allah in his weakness and hoped for their descendants.")
B.bPt=new A.eP("seerah-12","The Pledges of Aqabah","The people of Yathrib reach for the Prophet \u2014 a city will be renamed after him.")
B.aHQ=s([B.bPo,B.bPM,B.bPK,B.bPz,B.bPE,B.bPn,B.bPp,B.bPD,B.bPr,B.bPI,B.bPs,B.bPA,B.bPt],t.hN)
B.bPj=new A.MP("Makkah \u2014 The Formation","Born in the Year of the Elephant, raised an orphan, trusted before he was believed: the Makkan era forms the man. Read these chapters in order \u2014 each one stands alone, together they are a life.",B.aHQ)
B.bPx=new A.eP("seerah-13","The Hijrah","The cave of Thawr: \u201cDo not grieve; indeed Allah is with us\u201d (9:40).")
B.bPB=new A.eP("seerah-14","The Arrival in Madinah","Quba, then the camel that was \u201ccommanded\u201d where to kneel.")
B.bPJ=new A.eP("seerah-15","The Charter of Madinah","One document binding Muslims, Jews, and pagans of the city \u2014 the first pluralist charter.")
B.bPG=new A.eP("seerah-16","The Qibla Changes","From Jerusalem to Makkah \u2014 the direction turns, the meaning deepens.")
B.bPl=new A.eP("seerah-17","Badr: The Two Armies Meet","A little over three hundred against some nine hundred to a thousand \u2014 and Allah\u2019s help (3:123-126).")
B.bPq=new A.eP("seerah-18","Badr: The Prisoners","\u201cTreat the prisoners well\u201d \u2014 Ibn Ishaq\u2019s account of the prisoners of Badr.")
B.bPP=new A.eP("seerah-19","Uhud: The Day the Line Broke","Fifty archers told to hold a hill \u2014 and the lesson of obedience cost seventy lives.")
B.bPL=new A.eP("seerah-20","Uhud: Hamza and the Women","The Prophet\u2019s uncle fell; his grief, and the verse that taught patience (16:126).")
B.bPC=new A.eP("seerah-21","The Trench","A city defended with a ditch and words \u2014 Salman\u2019s idea, thirty days of digging.")
B.bPO=new A.eP("seerah-22","Hudaybiyyah","A treaty that looked like surrender \u2014 and a sura that named a clear conquest (48:1).")
B.bPH=new A.eP("seerah-23","Khaybar","After the broken truce, the fortress fell \u2014 and the Prophet ate poisoned food that would carry to his final illness.")
B.bPF=new A.eP("seerah-25","Hunayn and the Return to Taif","Victory over ten thousand at Hunayn, and he went back to the city that stoned him \u2014 to call them again.")
B.aAm=s([B.bPx,B.bPB,B.bPJ,B.bPG,B.bPl,B.bPq,B.bPP,B.bPL,B.bPC,B.bPO,B.bPH,B.bPF],t.hN)
B.bPi=new A.MP("Madinah \u2014 The Building","The Hijrah turns a persecuted group into a community with a charter, a qibla, and a future. Madinah is where the message learns to build: law, mercy, and the hardest tests of leadership.",B.aAm)
B.bPm=new A.eP("seerah-24","The Conquest of Makkah","Ten thousand entered the city of his birth \u2014 \u201cGo, for you are the freed ones.\u201d")
B.bPN=new A.eP("seerah-26","Tabuk","The hardest expedition \u2014 nine days\u2019 march in the heat, and the hypocrites exposed by their absence.")
B.bPy=new A.eP("seerah-27","The Farewell Sermon","No Arab has superiority over a non-Arab \u2014 blood and wealth and honor are sacred: the constitution of the ummah.")
B.bPw=new A.eP("seerah-28","The Passing of the Prophet \ufdfa","He died in Aisha\u2019s arms with his head on her lap, in the room beside the masjid \u2014 and the community learned to live without him.")
B.bPu=new A.eP("seerah-29","What He Left","No silver, no gold, no land \u2014 he left the Qur\u2019an and the example, and they have outlived every empire.")
B.bPv=new A.eP("seerah-30","Reflections: The Man Who Walked Beside Us","Aisha was asked about his character; she said: his character was the Qur\u2019an. Read this one last.")
